><strong>HELP YOUR FRIENDS! OR DON'T.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork makes the dream work. Sabotage makes great clips. Choose wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/9cfeb7c6d4f5d9a9d043f72d5b7eaa56.poster.avif?t=1778276519\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/9cfeb7c6d4f5d9a9d043f72d5b7eaa56.webm?t=1778276519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/9cfeb7c6d4f5d9a9d043f72d5b7eaa56.mp4?t=1778276519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCAVENGERS BEWARE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beeping junk is never good junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/59f9da97114f2018954498dbdf18e495.poster.avif?t=1778276519\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/59f9da97114f2018954498dbdf18e495.webm?t=1778276519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/59f9da97114f2018954498dbdf18e495.mp4?t=1778276519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRESS TO IMPRESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your car so your friends always know whose fault it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/fe74d7c4c9497eb3349979ab3773f070.poster.avif?t=1778276519\" width