ion of Creative BC &amp; Canada Media Fund.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends, pick up the P.A.C.K.A.G.E., and set out across a chaotic wasteland. Explore for salvage, upgrade your ride, and survive long enough to make the delivery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/1f3bc4830556df38c2c07e0a73c23884.poster.avif?t=1778276519\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/1f3bc4830556df38c2c07e0a73c23884.webm?t=1778276519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/1f3bc4830556df38c2c07e0a73c23884.mp4?t=1778276519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENJOY UPS AND DOWNS WITH YOUR CRANE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the package. Pick up your friends. Pick up friends picking up friends who are picking up friends that picked up a friend who picked up the package.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/a55f88cc4653f20ae24631eb30b82812.poster.avif?t=1778276519\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/a55f88cc4653f20ae24631eb30b82812.webm?t=1778276519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043720/extras/a55f88cc4653f20ae24631eb30b82812.mp4?t=1778276519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HELP YOUR FRIENDS! OR DON'T.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork makes the dream work. Sabotage makes great clips. Choose wis